                    },
                    "message": "nit : If make sense, you can mention what all inotify events we're handling in commit message also."
                },
                {
                    "file": "/COMMIT_MSG",
                    "line": 13,
                    "reviewer": {
                        "name": "Manish Tiwari",
                        "email": "tmanish.in+openbmc@gmail.com",
                        "username": "manishtwari"
                    },
                    "message": "I do not think listing specific inotify events makes sense here, since this change is a refactor to support handling any inotify event."
